   "lines": [
    [
     "c13_1",
     {
      "label": "hook",
      "head": "What happens when you *turn the key*?",
      "pose": "point",
      "face": "grin",
      "prop": {
       "type": "charging",
       "mode": "start"
      }
     },
     "What actually happens in the second you turn the key, or press start?"
    ],
    [
     "c13_2",
     {
      "label": "starter",
      "head": "The *starter motor* spins the engine",
      "pose": "present",
      "face": "wow",
      "prop": {
       "type": "charging",
       "mode": "start"
      }
     },
     "The battery sends a huge current, hundreds of amps, to the starter motor, which spins the engine until it fires."
    ],
    [
     "c13_3",
     {
      "label": "battery",
      "head": "The battery is *drained* a bit",
      "pose": "shrug",
      "face": "smug",
      "prop": {
       "type": "bank",
       "label": "BATTERY CHARGE",
       "from": 100,
       "to": 97,
       "pre": "",
       "chip": "percent, after starting"
      }
     },
     "Starting takes a big gulp of energy from the battery. Now something has to put it back."
    ],
    [
     "c13_4",
     {
      "label": "alternator",
      "head": "The *alternator* recharges it",
      "pose": "present",
      "face": "smile",
      "prop": {
       "type": "charging"
      }
     },
     "Once running, a belt from the engine spins the alternator, which generates electricity to recharge the battery."
    ],
    [
     "c13_5",
     {
      "label": "everything",
      "head": "It powers *everything*",
      "pose": "count",
      "face": "grin",
      "prop": {
       "type": "tags",
       "items": [
        "LIGHTS",
        "WIPERS",
        "RADIO",
        "COMPUTERS",
        "BATTERY"
       ]
      }
     },
     "While driving, the alternator powers the lights, wipers, radio and all the computers."
    ],
    [
     "c13_6",
     {
      "label": "warning",
      "head": "Battery light = *charging problem*",
      "pose": "shy",
      "face": "worried",
      "prop": {
       "type": "dash",
       "hi": [
        "battery"
       ]
      }
     },
     "If the battery warning light comes on while driving, the alternator usually is not charging. Get it checked soon."
    ],
    [
     "c13_7",
     {
      "label": "life",
      "head": "Batteries wear out",
      "pose": "think",
      "face": "think",
      "prop": {
